# avc:  denied  { set } for parameter=persist.assessment.is_active pid=13767 uid=1000 gid=1000 scontext=u:r:assessment_service:s0 tcontext=u:object_r:persist_param:s0 tclass=parameter_service permissive=1
# TODO(exam-mode): deferred with the assessment_writable_param label, which needs a
# platform memory registration (one page-sized shared memory file per label).
# tcontext reads persist_param only because the capture device had not loaded our
# parameter_contexts. Do not grant set on persist_param instead: "persist." is a
# catch-all prefix, so that would allow writing almost every persist.* parameter.
# Meanwhile these writes are denied under enforcing, but SaveState()/ClearState()
# only publish a trace event and do not abort, and LoadState() has no caller.
# allow assessment_service assessment_writable_param:parameter_service { set };

